Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.72,0:00:07.13,CN,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}总算可以回去了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.13,0:00:09.98,CN,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}明天也得早起 今天就住这边了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.98,0:00:10.90,CN,,57,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}真的假的？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}这地方是你们的店 但本质上还是{\fscx25}　{\fscx}DA{\fscx25}　{\fscx}的设施啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.81,0:00:23.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不过 住宿的时候一般都是…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}帝国酒店
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}为什么要来{\fscx25}　{\fscx}LycoReco…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.79,0:00:29.73,CN,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}来取走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.73,0:00:30.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}好的 老师
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}泷奈你能懂吗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.49,0:00:35.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}应该不懂吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}风希 你喝牛奶昔可以吧
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.39,0:00:37.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}别熬夜太晚了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.06,CN,,67,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}好！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}风希
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.35,0:00:46.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}风希
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.87,0:00:48.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}准备好了哦
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.75,CN,,68,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}你们回家去啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}当然要开睡衣派对啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}你们是住一起吗
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我正在找房子
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}一直一起住也没关系哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}我说 电波塔
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.73,0:01:07.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.43,0:01:08.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不行哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.24,0:01:11.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}就一下下 就一下下嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}有什么关系
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}又不会少块肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.93,0:01:23.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}这就是首席的景色吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.32,0:01:26.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}我是绝对不会借给你的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.57,0:01:29.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}我以前偷偷试穿过你的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}胸口好紧…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.93,0:01:33.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}你什么意思啊 你这混蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.79,0:01:35.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}会不会有强盗来呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}说不定又会来哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.63,0:01:40.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不会来的啦 快点换衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.01,0:01:41.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我要关灯了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}睡了睡了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}啊 等一下 再等一下下
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.95,0:02:28.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}等…等…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.22,0:02:29.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}是强盗吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.76,0:02:31.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}又来了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.56,0:02:34.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你看到什么了吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}往后门那边去了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.61,CN,,0,600,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}收到
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.61,CN,,600,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}你什么都没看到对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.98,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}喝太多了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.46,CN,,0,1200,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}你吵死了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}办案啦 办案啦
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}办案啦 办案啦
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.46,0:03:01.08,CN,,0,1350,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}吵死了 Lycoris
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.48,0:03:01.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}你就不能安静点吗 搞什么名堂啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.25,0:03:02.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}小事一桩
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}办案啦 办案啦
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.24,0:03:04.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}什么啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}诶 风希
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.59,0:03:06.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}干嘛啦
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.39,0:03:07.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}那…那个 那是什么
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.31,0:03:07.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}什么
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.11,0:03:12.72,CN,,68,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}快点睡觉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:07.13,JP,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}やっと帰れるっすね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:09.98,JP,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}明日も早ぇから　今日はこっちに泊まりだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:10.90,JP,,38,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}マジっすか？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.42,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}やった～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.93,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}お前らの店である前に　ここもDAの施設なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:23.05,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}でも　泊まりのときはだいたい…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.36,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}帝国ホテル
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.36,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}ですよね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.98,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}なぜリコリコに…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:29.73,JP,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}取りにきてくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:30.97,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}はい　先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.49,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}たきなにわかるかな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:35.11,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}わかんないだろうな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:37.39,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}フキはミルクセーキでいいよな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:37.94,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}はい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:40.90,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H68567A&\blur3}あんまり夜更かしするんじゃないぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.06,JP,,44,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}はい！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.44,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}フキ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:46.11,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}フキ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:48.24,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}準備できたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.75,JP,,45,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}お前らは家に帰れよ！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.62,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}パジャマパーティーでしょうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:56.67,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}じゃあ一緒に住んでんのか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.35,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}部屋探し中です
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.82,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ずっと居てくれていいんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.63,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}なあ　電波塔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:07.43,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}ダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:08.24,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}ダメですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:11.03,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}ちょっとだけ　ちょっとだけっすよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.90,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}いいじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:16.51,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}減るもんじゃないし
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:23.32,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H1D64BB&\blur3}これがファーストの景色か
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:26.08,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3A4060&\blur3}私はぜってぇ貸さねえからな
